{"id": "g:es:219", "text": "Ustedes preguntan demasiado.", "tr": {"en": "You ask too much.", "nl": "U vraagt te veel."}, "tr_src": {"en": "claude-gen", "nl": "claude-gen"}, "src": "claude-gen (present-ar: preguntar presente.ellos/ellas)", "unit": "u9", "tokens": [{"t": "Ustedes", "lex": "es:ustedes"}, {"t": "preguntan", "pre": " ", "lex": "es:preguntar", "form": "presente.ellos/ellas"}, {"t": "demasiado", "pre": " ", "lex": "es:demasiado"}, {"t": ".", "is_word": false}]}
